          "text": "Témoignages: [AERO LOC] BAR-SUR-LOUP (LE) (06) 26.10.2014",
          "text_sha256": "113373ac8f3dade940ad7888f168a4549a02923f03f65af885f4be71e772665b"
        },
        {
          "end_ms": null,
